/T (Cybersecurity Analyst with experience in Vulnerability Assessment and Penetration Testing \(VAPT\), SOC operations, web application security, and IT infrastructure support through internships and cybersecurity projects. Skilled in using Burp Suite, Metasploit, Nmap, Nessus, Wireshark, and Python/Bash scripting for security testing, threat analysis, and automation. Developed MetaWarden, a Flask-based metadata privacy risk analysis tool, as part of a First-Class Honours BSc \(Hons\) Cyber Security degree from the University of West London. Familiar with OWASP Top 10, Active Directory security, endpoint hardening, and Linux environments. Currently pursuing CompTIA Security+ while strengthening skills in SIEM operations, incident response, and cloud security.)
